# Publish to the site

When a web change is finished and working, publish it to sonatrio.com in the same turn. Do not ask whether to push, and do not wait for a second confirmation.

- Commit the source, run `npm run build` (output is `docs/`), drop license files that only changed line endings, then commit the site build.
- Fast-forward `main` and push `origin main`. GitHub Pages serves the committed `docs/` folder.
- Tell the user it is live and to hard-refresh (Ctrl+F5).
